msgid "To see what's going on, you can use the [`decompose`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#decompose) method to expand each instruction into its definition.\n"
msgstr "Para makita kung ano ang nangyayari, maaari mong gamitin ang pamamaraang [`decompose`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#decompose) para palawakin ang bawat instruksyon sa kahulugan nito.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
