#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/construct-circuits/extracted-outputs/a580552c-d585-4047-99f0-32aafd06e4f3-0.svg)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/construct-circuits/extracted-outputs/a580552c-d585-4047-99f0-32aafd06e4f3-0.svg)\n"

